I think this is the wrong way around; r-base-core should `Breaks:
r-cran-rlang (<< 1.2.0-1~)` and r-cran-rlang should `Depends:
r-base-core (>= 4.6.0-1~)`.  The same for the other packages affected
in this way; r-cran-vctrs, r-cran-lobstr, etc.

I don't think packages affected by the r-graphics-engine-* change;
r-cran-cairo, r-cran-magic, etc. need more work.  The new builds
automatically pick up a dependency on r-graphics-engine-17, and should
migrate together with r-base 4.6.0.

Excuses for r-base say:
Migrates after: r-cran-cairo, r-cran-magick, r-cran-ragg,
r-cran-tikzdevice, rkward

Excuses for r-cran-cairo, r-cran-magick say:
Migrates after: r-base

Regards
Graham

