Hello everybody,

Inspired by the increasing number of upstreams who make copyright
statements like "Copyright 2026 <package name> authors", I tried in my
recent package submissions to the NEW queue to assign the copyright on
the files under "debian/*" to the "Debian R Packages Maintainers Team"
and they were accepted with no problem.

I propose to make it the default in the output of dh-make-R, which
already defaults to "Debian R Packages Maintainers" for the Maintainer
field.  Please let me know if you have objections.

Have a nice day,

Charles

