On Sat, 9 May 2026 at 09:39, Charles Plessy <plessy at debian.org> wrote:
> Graham, we will also need help from the Release Team because one of
> r-cran-vctrs’ dependencies has a test regression on riscv64
> (<https://tracker.debian.org/pkg/r-cran-sparsevctrs>). It’s unlikely to
